title: Alt+click on a folder of the file list opens it and every folder inside it, a second Alt+click closes them all, and a folder row no longer has a minus button
folders: tree-nested

wait 3500
left files
wait 1200
files hover app
wait 1500
mark hover-folder-two-buttons
wait 300
files mods alt
files click app
wait 1500
files mods none
mark alt-click-opens-all
wait 300
files mods alt
files click app
wait 1500
files mods none
mark alt-click-closes-all
wait 300
files click app
wait 1500
mark plain-click-opens-one
wait 500
quit
